---
title: "Wizard Finish: one atomic list"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Finish shown
  s1: Finishing
  s2: Wizard gone, Close tab shown
  s3: Done, object opens
  s4: Failed, says why, Retry shown
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: presses Finish or Retry
  s0 --> s2: list commits, or is refused as gone or reply lost, ending read or a list from before a reload ends
  s1 --> s0: the operation refuses the list, says why or tab reloads
  s1 --> s3: list commits, or is refused as gone or reply lost, ending read or list refused, ending names the object
  s1 --> s2: reply lost, ending read or the operation refuses the list, says why or a write fails, list discarded or list commits, or is refused as gone or tab reloads
  s1 --> s4: a write fails, list discarded
  s3 --> s2: tab reloads
  s4 --> s0: tab reloads
  s4 --> s1: presses Finish or Retry
  s4 --> s2: list commits, or is refused as gone or reply lost, ending read or a list from before a reload ends
